From 7ff47423997a313b46ceefd73bb28a52b8dcbf07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Evlogiev <quic_ievlogie@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Feb 2023 09:54:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] tensorflow-lite: Bring-up TFLite on LE platforms

- Add additional optimization compile time flags
- Add LE specific folders for loading dsp library
- Enable hexagon delegate
- Enable NN API
- Use dynamic loading for cdsprpc

Signed-off-by: Ivan Evlogiev <quic_ievlogie@quicinc.com>

Change-Id: Ia59900d14cb5c7e6a9b4c274c553ae67d8eb10a3
